CARRIED PATCH - fork content, not upstream. Provenance and why, for whoever
reads this.

Source: RyanDam/zephyr commit ac2504c916f1, "soc: nordic: Allow disabling
binding header validation", by Pete Johanson, part of the v4.4.1+zmk-fixes
fork branch. Not in upstream Zephyr 4.4 or 4.5.

Why we need it: soc/nordic/validate_binding_headers.c is compiled with
"-include <each dt-bindings header the devicetree pulled in>", to check Zephyr's
Nordic bindings against the MDK. ZMK's keymap pulls in its own dt-bindings
headers, and app/include/dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h defines single-letter macros
(A, B, ... Q) for HID usages. nrfx.h then reaches CMSIS core_cm4.h, which uses
those letters as register bitfield member names, so the compile dies with, e.g.,
  dt-bindings/zmk/hid_usage_pages.h:33:24: error: expected identifier or '('
  before numeric constant
  note: in expansion of macro 'Q'  (core_cm4.h:279: uint32_t Q:1;)
The check can only ever validate Zephyr's own bindings, so ZMK turns it off
(app/Kconfig: NRF_SOC_VALIDATE_HEADERS_DISABLED default y) - which needs this
Kconfig knob to exist.

Deviation from the fork commit: the Kconfig hunk is re-anchored (in 4.5
SOC_FAMILY_NORDIC_NRF moved down the file and NRF_SOC_SECURE_SUPPORTED gained a
SOC_SERIES_NRF92 dependency). Content is the fork's.

Applied to: zephyr/ (paths below are relative to the zephyr tree root).
Delete when: the knob is upstreamed, or Zephyr stops -including application
dt-bindings headers into that check.

Verified against: Zephyr v4.5.0 (2026-11-19).
diff --git a/soc/nordic/CMakeLists.txt b/soc/nordic/CMakeLists.txt
index 77eaa32210..79f7cda386 100644
--- a/soc/nordic/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/soc/nordic/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -8,10 +8,11 @@ endif()
 
 zephyr_library_sources(
   validate_base_addresses.c
-  validate_binding_headers.c
   validate_enabled_instances.c
   )
 
+zephyr_library_sources_ifdef(CONFIG_NRF_SOC_VALIDATE_HEADERS validate_binding_headers.c)
+
 # Include dt-bindings headers into the build. This lets us validate all required
 # DT values against the MDK, without having to conditionally include different
 # headers for different SoCs.
diff --git a/soc/nordic/Kconfig b/soc/nordic/Kconfig
index 555cfe8392..a54a24f7b5 100644
--- a/soc/nordic/Kconfig
+++ b/soc/nordic/Kconfig
@@ -56,6 +56,17 @@ if SOC_FAMILY_NORDIC_NRF
 rsource "common/Kconfig.peripherals"
 rsource "*/Kconfig"
 
+config NRF_SOC_VALIDATE_HEADERS_DISABLED
+	bool "Disable NRF binding header validation"
+
+config NRF_SOC_VALIDATE_HEADERS
+	bool "Validate NRF dt-binding headers"
+	default y
+	depends on !NRF_SOC_VALIDATE_HEADERS_DISABLED
+	help
+	  Build an additional check to validate included dt-binding headers
+	  match the MDK.
+
 config NRF_SOC_SECURE_SUPPORTED
 	def_bool !TRUSTED_EXECUTION_NONSECURE || (BUILD_WITH_TFM && TFM_PARTITION_PLATFORM)
 	depends on !SOC_SERIES_NRF54H
